<!--
id: T06
name: Plan cancelled
layout: base
kind: transactional
sender: hi
category: billing
topic: none
trigger: subscription_cancelled
phase: 1
subject: Your Hydrilla plan is cancelled
preheader: Here is when your paid access ends.
footer_reason: You're receiving this because a plan on your Hydrilla account was cancelled.
optional: false
send_rule: sent once, when the cancellation is scheduled (with access_ends_on) or when it takes effect immediately (without)
data: plan_name, access_ends_on
-->
<mj-text>Hi {{ customer.first_name | default: "there" }},</mj-text>
<mj-raw>{% if trigger.access_ends_on %}</mj-raw>
<mj-text>Your {{ trigger.plan_name | default: "Hydrilla" }} plan is cancelled. You can keep using it until {{ trigger.access_ends_on | default: "the end of your billing period" }}, and you won't be charged again.</mj-text>
<mj-raw>{% else %}</mj-raw>
<mj-text>Your {{ trigger.plan_name | default: "Hydrilla" }} plan is cancelled and your paid access has ended.</mj-text>
<mj-raw>{% endif %}</mj-raw>
<mj-text>Your models stay in your account. If you change your mind, you can subscribe again at any time.</mj-text>
<mj-button href="https://hydrilla.ai/app/pricing">View plans</mj-button>
